  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RECLAIM Sustainability! Malawi - Tea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to:
Establish and strengthen regional and local multi stakeholder platforms where civil society is present, actively engaging and influencing policy agendas. 
Advocate for the improvement of policies and/or enforcement on safety, healthcare, sexual reproductive health services for female workers, environment, gender, trade and human rights, Improve bargaining position and equitable access to (digital) market intelligence for growers and workers as a result of innovative data collection, onduct regional campaigns through relevant different platforms including social media to raise awareness on decent work, fair value distribution and sustainable resource management in the sector.</narrative>
  </description>
